WHAT IS NOT PROVEN HERE
The panel's orientation and colour order, the WS2812 timing on the badge's own strip, the SC7A20
probe and BLE+Wi-Fi coexistence on the car have never run on hardware. The first two are the
PANEL_* switches in badge_pins.h (guide section 4); the last is -DHAS_ESPNOW=0.
